tion is authoritative for this planning agent: declare `\"data_catalog\": { \"package\": \"../data-catalog/ontology-shared-package.json\" }`. I'll follow that.\n\nNow let's read the API schema and operations and tests folder of lending. Also read catalog package files and ontology.\n\nLet me also check the loan-payments progress file and requirements file (already given in prompt but let me check the actual file). Also check the requirements file content matches. And check the .datasqrl progress."}
