new-project\n**Date**: 2026-11-24T08:44:55Z\n**Status**: DRAFT\n\nA new DataSQRL pipeline in `loan-payments/` that ... reuses the shared `data-catalog`...\n\n---\n\n## Requirements Source\n[PENDING: Requirements Source]\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n[PENDING: Implementation Checklist]\n\n## Data Quality & Observability\n[PENDING: Data Quality & Observability]\n\n## Technical Decisions\n[PENDING: Technical Decisions]\n\n## Assumptions\n[PENDING: Assumptions]\n```\n\nThen edits.\n\nThe one/two sentence summary goes after the header lines before the `---`.\n\nLet me write it.", "thinkingSignature": "reasoning_content"}, {"type": "text", "text": "I have enough context. Now I'll write the plan skeleton and fill it section by section."}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_01a20cbbc37d79c3a59672a9", "name": "write", "arguments": {"path": "/workspace/loan-payments/adr/plan_20261124-084455.md", "content": "---\ndomains:\n  - finance\nscenario: pipeline\n---\n\n# Implementation Plan: Personal Loan Payments API\n\n**Scenario**: pipeline\n**Task**: new-project\n**Date**: 2026-11-24T08:44:55Z\n**Status**: DRAFT\n\nA new DataSQRL pipeline in `loan-payments/` that reads the shared `data-catalog` consumer-loan\nsources, builds a per-loan payment summary and a per-payment table, and serves them through a\nJWT-authorized GraphQL/REST/MCP API. It reuses the catalog connectors, its test data and the\nproject layout of the sibling `lending/` project, and adds no data of its own.\n\n---\n\n## Requirements Source\n[PENDING: Requirements Source]\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n[PENDING: Implementation Checklist]\n\n## Data Quality & Observability\n[PENDING: Data Quality & Observability]\n\n## Technical Decisions\n[PENDING: Technical Decisions]\n\n## Assumptions\n[PENDING: Assumptions]\n"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "together", "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash", "usage": {"input": 661, "output": 4016, "cacheRead": 106752, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 3713, "totalT